FEATURE REQUIREMENTS

* We need to load images to individual cards in a deck, not only the leader
* Each photo will be saves with the code on the cards (OPXX-XX)
* The cards code can start with OP (standard expansion), ST (starter deck), P (promo), EB (Extra Booster) or PRB (Premium Booster)
* When a new card is added to a deck, if that card has an already loaded file it should load it directly
* Only one photo per card, if the user updates the card it overrides the previous one (not backup photo)
* The resolution should be resized to fit the page at minimun to be legible in the web 
* Right now it will not be an over card evento to zoom it, we can discuss it in later feature
* It should have a default card if not found
* The photos cant be exported in the json
